# ── PROTECTIVE .gitignore ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~/Source is wired to the PUBLIC repo siddeepak2023.github.io.
# Everything below is excluded so an accidental `git add -A` can NEVER
# publish source code, secrets, data, or personal files to the public web.

# Secrets — never publish
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*serviceAccount*.json
**/*credentials*.json
**/firebase-adminsdk*.json
*.pem
*.key

# Product source code (has its own repos / secrets)
BizFalconAI/
clipforge/
clipfalcon/
Universe-Data-Visualization/
HypeClip AI/

# Data-analysis projects (raw data / not for public site)
Netflix-Stock-Sales-Prediction/
Olist_ecommerce_analysis/
spotify_ab_test/
tmobile_churn/
Business Reccomendation Engine/
Pirani/

# Coursework / archives / personal
CS1436/
Java/
LetterOrDigit/
Deepak.Sid/
Private Problems Archive/

# Friday — personal AI OS. LOCAL-ONLY. Never publish (faith/health/people/journal).
friday/

# Personal documents
*.pdf
*.docx
Siddharth_Deepak_Resume.*

# Internal notes / specs (not for the public site — specs now live in BizFalconAI/ product dirs)
LAUNCH-AND-DEPLOY.md

# Build / OS junk
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
dist/
.claude/

# Product docs + scratch — never publish
insightpilot/
portfolio/
.Rhistory

# Flight-delay project: pipeline generates synthetic data, so the "72M real BTS
# flights" framing is not supportable. Kept locally, excluded from the public site
# until it is rebuilt on real BTS data.
flight-delay-intelligence/
flight_delay_dashboard.html

# NBA project: lives in its own repo (github.com/siddeepak2023/nba-intelligence).
# The old dashboard + backtest layer priced every game at a constant -110, so its
# ROI figures were computed against a market that does not exist. Excluded here.
nba-intelligence/
nba_dashboard.html
